      "seed": 423014596,
      "version": 78,
      "versionNonce": 876482550,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783276490421,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " - 1 login → many profiles.\n  - 1 profile → exactly 1 marketplace and 1 advertiser.\n  - 1 seller account → many marketplaces → many profiles (US profile + CA profile = 2 profiles, same seller).\n  - 1 seller → many ASINs; 1 ASIN → many sellers (shared catalog — this trips people up).\n  - 1 ASIN → 1 brand-name string; 1 brand → many ASINs.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " - 1 login → many profiles.\n  - 1 profile → exactly 1 marketplace and 1 advertiser.\n  - 1 seller account → many marketplaces → many profiles (US profile + CA profile = 2 profiles, same seller).\n  - 1 seller → many ASINs; 1 ASIN → many sellers (shared catalog — this trips people up).\n  - 1 ASIN → 1 brand-name string; 1 brand → many ASINs.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
