    {
      "id": "LeALsLw4KSBJqlYDHzhZL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5287.136516887067,
      "y": 1430.0452650631637,
      "width": 1360.1796875,
      "height": 800,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 129017668,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1549444676,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783031455310,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  ── PHASE A · upsertBrand (HandleUpsertBrand, brands.go:505) ─────────────────────\n    1  brands  (PARENT)              InsertBrand  brands.go:628\n                                     is_parent=true, parent_brand_id=NULL, is_abstract=false\n                                     (all by column DEFAULT — that's what makes it the parent)\n                                     sets name, auth0_ids=[user], slug, contact_email\n    2  commissions  (optional)       InsertCommission  brands.go:920\n                                     ONLY if defaultCommission passed; expert_id=NULL (brand default),\n                                     coverage=ALL_PRODUCTS, \"Default brand commission\"\n    3  discounts    (optional)       InsertDiscount  brands.go:988\n    4  brands UPDATE + commit        brands.go:1142\n    5  Stripe customer               external (CreateStripeCustomerId) brands.go:1150\n    6  Auth0 org  → brands.org_id    AddBrandToOrg  brands.go:1156\n    7  brand_users (OWNER)           InsertBrandUser  brands.go:5525\n                                     → owner now lives in BOTH brands.auth0_ids[] and a brand_users row\n\n   ── PHASE B · Connect Amazon ────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n      (updateAmazonTokenRefresh, brands.go:6227)\n    8  brands UPDATE (TOS accepted)  UpdateBrandTOS  brands.go:6246\n    9  amz_brand_tokens             InsertAmazonRefreshToken  brands.go:6258  (AES-encrypted)\n   10  amz_ad_profiles  (N rows)    InsertAmzAdProfile  amz_ads.go:240\n                                     from Ads API /v2/profiles; brand_id = the PARENT,\n                                     is_active = false   ← NOT a child brand, just profile rows\n      (customer selects profiles → syncAmazonAds, brands.go:3661)\n   11  amz_ad_profiles UPDATE       UpdateProfilesActive  brands.go:3682   is_active=true\n   12  job_statuses (QUEUED)        brands.go:3719\n   13  SQS enqueue                  AMZ_PRD_INJ_TRG_BATCH → wayward-amz-ads  sqs.go:137\n\n   ── PHASE C · background, EXTERNAL lambda (inferred from FKs, code not in repo) ───\n   14  brands (PROFILE, child)      is_abstract=false, parent_brand_id=parent      ← inferred\n   15  brands (ABSTRACT)            is_abstract=true, one per distinct amz_brand_name ← inferred\n   16  products                     abstract_brand_id + amz_profile_id             ← inferred\n   17  storefronts                  brand↔profile join                            ← inferred",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  ── PHASE A · upsertBrand (HandleUpsertBrand, brands.go:505) ─────────────────────\n    1  brands  (PARENT)              InsertBrand  brands.go:628\n                                     is_parent=true, parent_brand_id=NULL, is_abstract=false\n                                     (all by column DEFAULT — that's what makes it the parent)\n                                     sets name, auth0_ids=[user], slug, contact_email\n    2  commissions  (optional)       InsertCommission  brands.go:920\n                                     ONLY if defaultCommission passed; expert_id=NULL (brand default),\n                                     coverage=ALL_PRODUCTS, \"Default brand commission\"\n    3  discounts    (optional)       InsertDiscount  brands.go:988\n    4  brands UPDATE + commit        brands.go:1142\n    5  Stripe customer               external (CreateStripeCustomerId) brands.go:1150\n    6  Auth0 org  → brands.org_id    AddBrandToOrg  brands.go:1156\n    7  brand_users (OWNER)           InsertBrandUser  brands.go:5525\n                                     → owner now lives in BOTH brands.auth0_ids[] and a brand_users row\n\n   ── PHASE B · Connect Amazon ────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n      (updateAmazonTokenRefresh, brands.go:6227)\n    8  brands UPDATE (TOS accepted)  UpdateBrandTOS  brands.go:6246\n    9  amz_brand_tokens             InsertAmazonRefreshToken  brands.go:6258  (AES-encrypted)\n   10  amz_ad_profiles  (N rows)    InsertAmzAdProfile  amz_ads.go:240\n                                     from Ads API /v2/profiles; brand_id = the PARENT,\n                                     is_active = false   ← NOT a child brand, just profile rows\n      (customer selects profiles → syncAmazonAds, brands.go:3661)\n   11  amz_ad_profiles UPDATE       UpdateProfilesActive  brands.go:3682   is_active=true\n   12  job_statuses (QUEUED)        brands.go:3719\n   13  SQS enqueue                  AMZ_PRD_INJ_TRG_BATCH → wayward-amz-ads  sqs.go:137\n\n   ── PHASE C · background, EXTERNAL lambda (inferred from FKs, code not in repo) ───\n   14  brands (PROFILE, child)      is_abstract=false, parent_brand_id=parent      ← inferred\n   15  brands (ABSTRACT)            is_abstract=true, one per distinct amz_brand_name ← inferred\n   16  products                     abstract_brand_id + amz_profile_id             ← inferred\n   17  storefronts                  brand↔profile join                            ← inferred",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dGNc_ZJCv0p-v1a1KC86p",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -6293.574811355625,
      "y": 1449.392907629144,
      "width": 496.1193542480469,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
