      "updated": 1783282767702,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Downsides\n\n1. Organization is becoming like an adservice native entity. Must be joined on in application logic\n2. Account is overloaded to mean one Boost / meta ad account and also has a Connect meaning\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
