      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Boost account\n1. One meta ad account\nOne facebook page, one ig account\n\nEntity that can run ads\n\naccount\n- brand-name is populated -> brand\n\n\naccount.brand_name is like an abstract brand in Connect",
